@host = http://localhost:5019

### Get all students
GET {{host}}/api/Students
Accept: application/json

### Get one student
GET {{host}}/api/Students/1

### Create a student -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/Students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Anna Andersson",
  "age": 22
}

### Business rule broken -> 400 (from ExceptionHandlingMiddleware)
POST {{host}}/api/Students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "age": 5
}

### Update -> 204
PUT {{host}}/api/Students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Anna Berg",
  "age": 23
}

### Delete -> 204
DELETE {{host}}/api/Students/1
